  "title": {
   "en": "RoboMonkey"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where the line between human and machine fades, an organization known as CTR fights to eliminate cyborgs.\nAmong their operatives is Sun, a skilled assassin loyal to their mission.\nPartnered with Wrench, a cybernetic monkey hybrid, he is sent to infiltrate Affamato, a ruthless cyborg mafia that holds Florence in its grip.\nBut when the mission goes awry, Sun's left to navigate a world where allies and enemies blur into one."
